        <h2>What is Grok PWA?</h2>
        <p>
          A Progressive Web App (PWA) allows you to "install" the Grok website (grok.com) directly onto your computer from a modern web browser like Chrome or Edge. This creates a desktop shortcut that opens Grok in its own dedicated window, providing an app-like experience without downloading any executable files.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Important:</strong> There is no official Grok desktop application (.exe or .msi) provided by xAI. The PWA method is the only legitimate and safe way to access Grok on Windows or Mac desktops. Any website claiming to offer a downloadable Grok application is unauthorized and potentially distributing malware.
        </p>

        <h2>Why Install Grok as a PWA?</h2>
