            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300">
              <li><strong>Faster Startup:</strong> Launches without loading entire browser</li>
              <li><strong>Dedicated Window:</strong> No browser tabs or UI clutter</li>
              <li><strong>Taskbar/Dock Access:</strong> Pin to taskbar for quick access</li>
              <li><strong>Automatic Updates:</strong> Always runs the latest version</li>
              <li><strong>Keyboard Shortcuts:</strong> Alt+Tab between Grok and other apps</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="p-6 bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/20 rounded-lg border border-purple-200 dark:border-purple-800">
