              <li><strong>Browser:</strong> Chrome, Edge, Brave, or other Chromium-based</li>
              <li><strong>Internet:</strong> Stable connection required (no offline mode)</li>
              <li><strong>Account:</strong> X (Twitter) account or email registration</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>How to Install Grok PWA on Windows</h2>
        <p>
          Follow these step-by-step instructions to install Grok as a Progressive Web App on your Windows computer:
        </p>

        <h3>Method 1: Using Google Chrome</h3>
        <div class="bg-muted/50 p-6 rounded-lg my-8">
          <ol class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Open Google Chrome and navigate to <a href="https://grok.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">grok.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Sign in with your X (Twitter) account or create a new account</li>
            <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Click the three-dot menu icon in the top-right corner of Chrome</li>
            <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Select <strong>"Save and share"</strong> > <strong>"Install Grok..."</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Click "Install" in the confirmation dialog</li>
            <li><strong>Step 6:</strong> Grok will now appear as a desktop shortcut and in your Start menu</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <h3>Method 2: Using Microsoft Edge</h3>
        <div class="bg-muted/50 p-6 rounded-lg my-8">
          <ol class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Open Microsoft Edge and go to <a href="https://grok.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">grok.com</a></li>
            <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Sign in to your account</li>
            <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Click the three-dot menu icon in the top-right corner</li>
            <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Select <strong>"Apps"</strong> > <strong>"Install Grok"</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Confirm the installation by clicking "Install"</li>
            <li><strong>Step 6:</strong> Optionally, check "Pin to taskbar" for quick access</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <h2>How to Install Grok PWA on Mac</h2>
        <div class="bg-muted/50 p-6 rounded-lg my-8">
          <ol class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Open Chrome or Edge on your Mac</li>
            <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Navigate to <a href="https://grok.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary hover:underline">grok.com</a> and sign in</li>
            <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Click the install icon in the address bar (or use the menu)</li>
            <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Click "Install" to add Grok to your Applications folder</li>
            <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Access Grok from Spotlight search or your Dock</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

